## 2026-08-07 — Restore full artwork brightness; move legibility off the image

**What changed**

The hero was reading dull because legibility had been bought by dimming the art. Reversed that
approach: the plate now renders near the brightness of the source file, and contrast is earned by
where the type sits rather than by how dark the picture is.

- **Removed the heavy scrim.** The left-to-right wash was 0.94 → 0.34 alpha across the whole hero.
  It is now 0.6 → transparent by 54%, so the entire fibre bundle is untouched.
- **Removed `brightness(0.62)` from the back plane** (blur alone carries the depth-of-field read,
  saturation lifted to 1.3) and added a slight lift to the front plane
  (`saturate(1.08) contrast(1.04) brightness(1.05)`).
- **Recoloured `.glowDeep`** in HeroAtmosphere from a dark navy orb — which read as a grey smudge
  over the art — to a cool bloom that adds light instead of subtracting it.
- **Sized the copy to the artwork.** A column profile of the rendered plate showed white-on-image
  contrast holding at 12.6–17:1 out to 42% of the viewport, then collapsing to ~1.1 where the
  fibres begin. The headline was running to 69% (contrast 1.24:1). It is now capped at 12ch with a
  4.5rem ceiling and ends at 572px, inside the measured safe zone; the lede is capped at 38ch.
- **Added a lower-left pool** to the veil. The dark part of the artwork is the upper-left quadrant
  only — cyan strands sweep back across the lower left, straight through the lede and the note
  under the form (worst pixel `rgb(133,205,212)` at x562/y676). A radial anchored at 15%/80% seats
  that block without reaching the bundle.
- **Added a header gradient shim.** Nav links measured **1.2:1** over the now-bright plate. The
  shim is header chrome, not a wash over the image: top 150px only, feathered, and it fades to
  zero once the bar turns solid on scroll.
- Glints masked off the copy column, layered text-shadows on headline/lede/note, and the lede
  moved from 72% white to solid white.

**Files touched**
`src/components/sections/Hero.module.css`, `src/components/hero/HeroPlate.module.css`,
`src/components/hero/HeroAtmosphere.module.css`, `src/components/layout/SiteHeader.module.css`

